%% UI owners: src/pages/message-v3/components/drawer/chat-settings/group-announcement-section/group-announcement-section.component.ts::deleteAnnouncement；src/pages/message-v3/components/drawer/chat-settings/group-announcement-section/group-announcement-section.component.ts::refreshAnnouncementsAfterDelete
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：有权限的成员在公告区删掉一条公告，列表里这条公告消失，其余公告保持原样。
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=partial；helix=partial；dual=yes；personaLocal=yes；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: deleteAnnouncement(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_announcement_delete", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_announcement_delete", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_announcement_delete", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 删除一条群公告 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /post/announcement/delete
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  Go-->>WS: WS authority event or canonical result
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(authority bytes)
  E->>IM: apply authoritative event before settlement
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction announcement version + list + channel cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM-->>E: Command Result {data}
  E-->>Gate: PortReply(Result)
  Gate-->>UI: render absolute snapshot or query result
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：Go 删除事务提交后返回 channelId,deletedAnnouncementId,version；version 是该频道公告单调版本，deletedAnnouncementId 必须等于请求 announcementId；Helix 收到权威回执后重拉同 channelId 的完整列表，并向 Angular 投影同 version 的绝对 announcements；Angular 不先 splice 本地数组
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：删除与公告 version 必须在同一 Go 事务提交：实际删除才递增一次；未命中或重复删除返回当前版本且不广播；announcementChanged audience 固定为删除提交后仍有频道可见权的成员，回执与广播必须使用同一 channelId/version
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：无业务事件；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
